(5994794, 878272, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lighting and sepia tone is good. You used some depth of field and it gives it an old fahsioned feel. One troubling spot on the heel of the shoe where it is bright white with a significant loss of detail. It also appears along the top edge of the other wite spots on the same shoe. I like the image but the troubled spots keep it from being a high scorer in my voting range.</td>', 'Lighting and sepia tone is good. You used some depth of field and it gives it an old fahsioned feel. One troubling spot on the heel of the shoe where it is bright white with a significant loss of detail. It also appears along the top edge of the other wite spots on the same shoe. I like the image but the troubled spots keep it from being a high scorer in my voting range.', '2010-05-06 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994800, 877786, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice color but a little over saturated and over sharpened. I like the depth of field and the composition. One thing to try would be to eliminate the green background by raising the camera angle and shooting down on the shoes. Also possibly using a diffuser on the left side to even out the light.</td>', 'Nice color but a little over saturated and over sharpened. I like the depth of field and the composition. One thing to try would be to eliminate the green background by raising the camera angle and shooting down on the shoes. Also possibly using a diffuser on the left side to even out the light.', '2010-05-06 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994806, 877847, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. The weed in the foreground sticks out like a sore thumb! You could have picked it prior to shooting for a cleaner look.</td>', 'Very nice composition. The weed in the foreground sticks out like a sore thumb! You could have picked it prior to shooting for a cleaner look.', '2010-05-06 21:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994807, 878418, 10785, '<td valign="top">The brick wall was a poor choice of background for this. Pink would really pop against a green background.</td>', 'The brick wall was a poor choice of background for this. Pink would really pop against a green background.', '2010-05-06 21:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994808, 878195, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good detail. Very warm and nostalgic shot.</td>', 'Good detail. Very warm and nostalgic shot.', '2010-05-06 21:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
