(5994875, 878308, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the moody feel of this photograph.  The dark tones work ver well here and really emphasize the ball and cleats.<br/>I wish it was a little more obvious what the post is. I am assuming its part of the goal, but really there are no visual cues to indicate that besides the fact that the picture is soccer themed.</td>', 'I love the moody feel of this photograph.  The dark tones work ver well here and really emphasize the ball and cleats.I wish it was a little more obvious what the post is. I am assuming its part of the goal, but really there are no visual cues to indicate that besides the fact that the picture is soccer themed.', '2010-05-06 22:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994888, 875660, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, dramatic sky, and lovely tones. There is not much to criticize in this photo and I really like it!<br/>I would love to see how the original photo looked like. It seem like a lot of editing was done, but obviously it couldn''t have been THAT much under Basic editing.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, dramatic sky, and lovely tones. There is not much to criticize in this photo and I really like it!I would love to see how the original photo looked like. It seem like a lot of editing was done, but obviously it couldn''t have been THAT much under Basic editing.', '2010-05-06 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994897, 877158, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very creative and interesting shot.<br/>I do wish a little more would be in focus though.</td>', 'Very creative and interesting shot.I do wish a little more would be in focus though.', '2010-05-06 22:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994898, 878112, 37845, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to understand what I was looking at, but once I did I saw that this shot has a lot of impact. Great take on the challenge.</td>', 'Took me a while to understand what I was looking at, but once I did I saw that this shot has a lot of impact. Great take on the challenge.', '2010-05-06 22:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
