(5995883, 878104, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice camera angle giving a different and interesting viewpoint. The photo is somewhat grey and lacking in tonal depth. It looks like the contrast was dialed down. The depth of field used gives a good sense of distance in the photo and prevents it from being flat.</td>', 'Nice camera angle giving a different and interesting viewpoint. The photo is somewhat grey and lacking in tonal depth. It looks like the contrast was dialed down. The depth of field used gives a good sense of distance in the photo and prevents it from being flat.', '2010-05-07 15:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
