(6001078, 876838, 93565, '<td valign="top">Things appear a bit washed out as a whole. Feels like having the bench skewed relative to the viewer may make things feel more dynamic. Perhaps lowering the shooting angle too.</td>', 'Things appear a bit washed out as a whole. Feels like having the bench skewed relative to the viewer may make things feel more dynamic. Perhaps lowering the shooting angle too.', '2010-05-11 07:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
