(6001083, 878112, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot- it seems as though things are bit more distorted than I''d prefer. Somewhat difficult to discern the needle, so I was running through my head what other things the pills could be sports wise. Once I saw it, it''s really obvious, but it wasn''t initially (not always a bad thing).</td>', 'Interesting shot- it seems as though things are bit more distorted than I''d prefer. Somewhat difficult to discern the needle, so I was running through my head what other things the pills could be sports wise. Once I saw it, it''s really obvious, but it wasn''t initially (not always a bad thing).', '2010-05-11 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
